Privacy Policy

Simple: Gym Tracker does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

    All app data (your workouts, settings, preferences and training history) is stored only on
    this device, in the app's own local database. The app has no network access — the INTERNET
    permission is blocked — so nothing is ever sent to this project or to any third party.
    This app complies with privacy regulations, including GDPR and COPPA, as it does not collect
    any personal data.

If you have questions, please open an issue at: https://github.com/Lutmak/simple-gym-tracker/issues

(last updated on 4 September 2026)
